<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1316562708"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1533431244"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="タイムカプセル"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="TORIENA / Yunomi"/><amll:meta key="album" value="タイムカプセル"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:46.835"><div begin="00:12.354" end="03:33.391"><p begin="00:12.354" end="00:18.006" itunes:key="L1">小さな通知音<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">微小的提示音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi i sa na tsu u chi a u</span></p><p begin="00:18.341" end="00:24.055" itunes:key="L2">行き交う知らない言葉<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">交错着陌生的言语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki ka u shi ra na i ko to ba</span></p><p begin="00:24.203" end="00:29.451" itunes:key="L3">違う街の豪雨 噂より<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">异乡城市的暴雨 比流言蜚语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi ga u ma chi no go u u u wa sa yo ri</span></p><p begin="00:30.322" end="00:35.857" itunes:key="L4">心の傷が痛くて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">更刺痛内心的伤痕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro no ki zu ga i ta ku te</span></p><p begin="00:35.939" end="00:38.707" itunes:key="L5">蝉しぐれ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">蝉鸣此起彼伏 终有一日会将其深埋</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se mi shi gu re i tsu ka u me te 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:38.823" end="00:41.058" itunes:key="L6">いつか埋めてった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会被掩埋 终有一天</span></p><p begin="00:41.106" end="00:44.782" itunes:key="L7">夏の日のタイムカプセル<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夏日时光胶囊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na tsu no hi no ta i mu ka pu se ru</span></p><p begin="00:44.807" end="00:47.340" itunes:key="L8">静かに眠った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在寂静中沉眠</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi zu ka ni ne mu 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:47.678" end="00:50.834" itunes:key="L9">溶けたアイスクリーム<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">融化的冰淇淋</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ke ta a i su ku ri i mu</span></p><p begin="00:50.870" end="00:53.799" itunes:key="L10">ぬいぐるみと土埃の<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">玩偶与泥土尘埃气息中的亲吻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">nu i gu ru mi to tsu chi bo ko ri no ni o i no ki su mo</span></p><p begin="00:53.817" end="00:56.795" itunes:key="L11">匂いのキスも</p><p begin="00:56.842" end="00:59.746" itunes:key="L12">静かに眠った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在寂静中沉眠</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi zu ka ni ne mu 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:12.210" end="01:15.154" itunes:key="L13">弱い 弱い自分も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">脆弱的自己也好 狡猾狭窄的世界也罢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo wa i yo wa i ji bu n mo zu ru ku se ma i se ka i mo</span></p><p begin="01:15.244" end="01:18.043" itunes:key="L14">ずるく狭い世界も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身处这狡猾狭隘的世界里</span></p><p begin="01:18.198" end="01:20.612" itunes:key="L15">いつか いつか未来で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若能在某天某日的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka i tsu ka mi ra i de</span></p><p begin="01:20.655" end="01:27.314" itunes:key="L16">愛せたらいいな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">温柔相待该有多好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i se ta ra i i na</span></p><p begin="01:36.368" end="01:41.986" itunes:key="L17">傷つくことが嫌で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因害怕受到伤害</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu tsu ku ko to ga i ya de</span></p><p begin="01:42.334" end="01:48.136" itunes:key="L18">周りに合わせた歩幅<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">刻意配合周遭的步调</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma wa ri ni a wa se ta ho ha ba</span></p><p begin="01:48.234" end="01:53.430" itunes:key="L19">かたく閉じて縫った糸解いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拆开曾紧紧缝合的丝线</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ta ku to ji te nu 't ta i to ho do i te</span></p><p begin="01:54.330" end="01:59.879" itunes:key="L20">自由になれた気がした<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛终于获得了自由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji yu u ni na re ta ki ga shi ta</span></p><p begin="02:00.004" end="02:02.743" itunes:key="L21">通り雨<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">骤雨滂沱 终有一日会将其深埋</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to o ri a me i tsu ka u me te 't ta</span></p><p begin="02:02.841" end="02:05.089" itunes:key="L22">いつか埋めてった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会被掩埋 终有一天</span></p><p begin="02:05.119" end="02:08.637" itunes:key="L23">夏の日のタイムカプセル<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夏日时光胶囊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na tsu no hi no ta i mu ka pu se ru</span></p><p begin="02:08.790" end="02:11.432" itunes:key="L24">未だ夢の中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍停留在梦中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da yu me no na ka</span></p><p begin="02:11.649" end="02:14.639" itunes:key="L25">チョコレートの金貨<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">巧克力的金币</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">cho ko re e to no ki n ka</span></p><p begin="02:14.830" end="02:17.810" itunes:key="L26">スコップと消毒液の<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">小铲子与消毒水气味中的亲吻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ko 'p pu to sho u do ku e ki no ni o i no ki su mo</span></p><p begin="02:17.938" end="02:20.607" itunes:key="L27">匂いのキスも</p><p begin="02:20.695" end="02:23.661" itunes:key="L28">未だ夢の中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍停留在梦中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da yu me no na ka</span></p><p begin="02:24.307" end="02:26.584" itunes:key="L29">この世界にひとり生まれ落ちて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">独自降生于这个世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no se ka i ni hi to ri u ma re o chi te</span></p><p begin="02:26.988" end="02:30.039" itunes:key="L30">でもひとりじゃ少し寂しいって気づいたの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但孤身一人未免有些寂寞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo hi to ri ja su ko shi sa bi shi i 't te</span></p><p begin="02:30.769" end="02:33.290" itunes:key="L31">気づいたからこうやって歌を口ずさむ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我察觉到了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki du i ta ka ra ko u ya 't te</span></p><p begin="02:36.261" end="02:39.885" itunes:key="L32">楽しいこと悲しいこと巡りゆく季節<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快乐之事悲伤之事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta no shi i ko to ka na shi i ko to</span></p><p begin="02:40.065" end="02:41.932" itunes:key="L33">無情にも移ろいでく心<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">流转更迭的季节</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu jo u ni mo u tsu ro i de ku ko ko ro</span></p><p begin="02:42.747" end="02:44.872" itunes:key="L34">君が忘れても僕は覚えてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便你已遗忘 我也会铭记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ga wa su re te mo bo ku ha o bo e te ru</span></p><p begin="02:46.046" end="02:47.096" itunes:key="L35">僕になってく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逐渐成为真正的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ni na 't te ku</span></p><p begin="03:00.215" end="03:03.055" itunes:key="L36">弱い 弱い自分も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">脆弱的自己也好 狡猾狭窄的世界也罢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo wa i yo wa i ji bu n mo zu ru ku se ma i se ka i mo</span></p><p begin="03:03.224" end="03:06.007" itunes:key="L37">ずるく狭い世界も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身处这狡猾狭隘的世界里</span></p><p begin="03:06.130" end="03:08.577" itunes:key="L38">いつか いつか未来で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若能在某天某日的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka i tsu ka mi ra i de</span></p><p begin="03:08.708" end="03:15.398" itunes:key="L39">愛せたらいいな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">温柔相待该有多好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i se ta ra i i na</span></p><p begin="03:24.497" end="03:26.375" itunes:key="L40">この世界にひとり生まれ落ちて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">独自降生于这个世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no se ka i ni hi to ri u ma re o chi te</span></p><p begin="03:26.828" end="03:29.503" itunes:key="L41">でもひとりじゃ少し寂しいって気づいたの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但孤身一人未免有些寂寞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo hi to ri ja su ko shi sa bi shi i 't te</span></p><p begin="03:30.091" end="03:33.391" itunes:key="L42">気づいたからこうやって歌を口ずさむ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我察觉到了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki du i ta ka ra ko u ya 't te</span></p></div></body></tt>